      "full_text" : "槟城美食推荐3\n\n日料店\n①Kofuku \n他们的cheese Imo Mochi必TRY\nMiso Salmon\nChirashi Don \nbut不能带小孩去哦 不接待\n\n②Wanori Handroll Bar\n营业到深夜一点\nuni ikura\nthree kingdom\nUni caviar\n\n③Tonkatsu Akinai\n这家在city junction对面的prima tanjung里面 eco medic同排\n猪排",
